## Package Author Attribution

Each package (fengine, fwallet, fpay, fwk, fxAI, fagent, fwallet-mobile, finfra, fdocs) MUST include:

### Header Format (All Source Files)

```
/*
 * getfluxo.io - [Package Name]
 *
 * Author: Estandar Mustaq <estandarmustaq@getflux.io>
 * Copyright (c) 2026 getfluxo.io
 *
 * This file is part of the getfluxo.io Platform.
 * Proprietary and confidential - All rights reserved.
 *
 * [Brief description of module]
 *
 * OODA Cycle Compliance: Observe → Orient → Decide → Act
 * Version: 1.0.0
 */
```

### Python Files

```python
"""
getfluxo.io - [Package Name]

Author: Estandar Mustaq <estandarmustaq@getflux.io>
Copyright (c) 2026 getfluxo.io

This module is part of the getfluxo.io Platform.
Proprietary and confidential - All rights reserved.

[Brief description]
"""
```

### CODEOWNERS File (Each Submodule)

```
